   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>A function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> gives the number of stray cats in a town <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> years since the town started an animal control program. The program includes both sterilizing stray cats and finding homes to adopt them. An equation representing <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> is <span data-math=\"f(t)=243{(\\frac13)}^t\">f(t)=243{(\\frac13)}^t</span>.<br><br></li>\n  </ol><ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>What is the value of <span data-math=\"f(t)\">f(t)</span> when <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> is 0?</li>\n  </ol>",
